@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Lay danh sach bai tap (mong doi 200 OK)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Lay bai tap khong ton tai (mong doi 404 Not Found + ApiError ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 3. Nop bai hop le vao bai tap dang mo (mong doi 201 Created + header Location)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200377",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/hoangducviet04012006-ux/CNTTK23C"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo id tu response truoc (mong doi 200 OK)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Doc luot nop khong ton tai (mong doi 404 Not Found + ApiError SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6. Nop bai vao bai tap da dong id=3 (mong doi 400 Bad Request + ApiError ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200377",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/hoangducviet04012006-ux/CNTTK23C"
}

### 7. Nop bai thieu du lieu studentCode / repositoryUrl (mong doi 400 Bad Request + ApiError INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 8. Gui POST thieu header Content-Type (mong doi 415 Unsupported Media Type)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200377",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/hoangducviet04012006-ux/CNTTK23C"
}

